0..77 Comment "// η for products and records: a pair is the pair of its own projections and"
78..155 Comment "// a record the record of its own fields, as a function is the abstraction of"
156..235 Comment "// its own application (Martin-Löf, _Intuitionistic Type Theory_, Bibliopolis,"
236..314 Comment "// 1984). A neutral at a product, a record or a dependent pair converts to the"
315..388 Comment "// tuple of its projections on either side, so reflexivity at the neutral"
389..408 Comment "// proves the path."
